#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:1 docs/features/mobile-app.md:5
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:572
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mobile app (Android)"
msgstr "移动端 APP（Android）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Capacitor shell + unified shell-ui SPA (Chat / Admin / settings).  \n"
msgstr "> Capacitor 壳层 + 统一 shell-ui SPA（聊天室 / 管理台 / 设置）。  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Package: [`app/mobile/`](../../app/mobile/)\n"
msgstr "> 包路径：[`app/mobile/`](../../app/mobile/)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item       | Description                                                   |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Platform   | **Android only** sideload (APK); iOS later                    |\n"
"| Modules    | Chat (`sap-direct`) + Admin (`hub-rest`)                      |\n"
"| Hub config | APP **Hub settings**: URL + `remote_auth.token` (Preferences) |\n"
"| Hub duties | `/api` REST + `/sap/v1` WebSocket                             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 项目          | 说明                                                        |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 平台      | **仅 Android** 侧载（APK）；iOS 后续                         |\n"
"| 模块       | 聊天室（`sap-direct`）+ 管理台（`hub-rest`）                           |\n"
"| Hub 配置    | APP **Hub 设置**：URL + `remote_auth.token`（Preferences）      |\n"
"| Hub 职责    | `/api` REST + `/sap/v1` WebSocket                                  |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:19 docs/sap/overview.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Topology"
msgstr "拓扑"

